# ============================================================
#  Vivado project boundary for GitHub hosting
#  Only the authored sources in project_camera.srcs/ are tracked.
#  Everything Vivado generates (.cache/.gen/.hw/.sim/.ip_user_files/.xpr ...)
#  is intentionally ignored and stays in place for local builds.
# ============================================================

# 1) Ignore everything at the repository root by default.
/*

# 2) Re-include repository meta files.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# 3) Re-include the authored Vivado sources:
#    RTL (*.v), constraints (*.xdc), block design (*.bd), IP defs (*.xci), sim.
!/project_camera.srcs/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
#  Safety net: drop common Vivado-generated artifacts even if
#  they ever appear *inside* project_camera.srcs/.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.backup.jou
*.backup.log
.Xil/
*_synth_*/
*_impl_*/
